# Luminary marker — cli#254 CI token wire
- date: 2026-09-27
- branch: feat/254-ci-token-wire
- lead: jerome-saltzer-and-michael-schroeder
- supporting: [linus-torvalds]
- rationale:
  - lead (Saltzer-Schroeder) — least privilege. The workflow gets
    exactly the two extra env vars needed (SMOKE_GH_TOKEN,
    GH_SMOKE_REPO) and no more. GITHUB_TOKEN narrows to read-only.
    Docker run passes only documented env vars per anticorruption
    layer.
  - supporting (Linus) — adopter contract. If the SMOKE_GH_TOKEN
    secret is not set, the workflow still runs; the interactive V2i
    step in-container falls back to the Batch B/C flow that skips
    Class 3 skills. No hard fail when the secret is absent.
- balancing-check-role: Saltzer-Schroeder verifies least-privilege
  before merge.
